title: September 2021

@september_2021
# prose-audit: Grade A — Lukashenko's operation, the presidential emergency request and the people at the frontier form one concrete Lewica dilemma, with distinct institutional and human consequences for all four routes.
title: The border state of emergency
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 32
order: 60
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2021 and month = 9 and border_2021_done = 0
face-image: img/poland/events/belarus-border-2021.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const finiteBorder = function(value, fallback) {
    return Number.isFinite(Number(value)) ? Number(value) : fallback;
};
const borderRightsFit = (
    finiteBorder(Q.ko_accept_rights, 48) +
    finiteBorder(Q.p2050_accept_rights, 44)
) / 2;
const borderOrderFit = (
    finiteBorder(Q.ko_accept_order, 45) +
    finiteBorder(Q.psl_accept_order, 58) +
    finiteBorder(Q.pis_accept_order, 66)
) / 3;
const borderOpenness = (
    finiteBorder(Q.ko_coalition_openness, 48) +
    finiteBorder(Q.psl_coalition_openness, 34) +
    finiteBorder(Q.p2050_coalition_openness, 46)
) / 3;
Q.border_joint_package_open =
    borderRightsFit >= 38 &&
    borderOrderFit >= 42 &&
    borderOpenness >= 32 ? 1 : 0;
Q.border_joint_relation_payoff = Math.max(
    1,
    Math.min(5, Math.round((borderRightsFit + borderOrderFit) / 30))
);
Q.border_rights_relation_payoff = Math.max(
    -2,
    Math.min(4, Math.round((borderRightsFit - 35) / 12))
);
Q.border_order_relation_payoff = Math.max(
    1,
    Math.min(5, Math.round((borderOrderFit - 25) / 10))
);
Q.border_2021_done = 1;
Q.border_2021_event_done = 1;
Q.cultural_issue_salience += 10;
Q.story_queue = Array.isArray(Q.story_queue) ? Q.story_queue : [];
Q.story_queue.push({
    kind: "migration_border",
    title: "The eastern-border story contest",
    issue: "refugee_solidarity",
    label: "Empathy, border competence and lawful processing"
});
Q.public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 14;
Q.public_mood_pending_border_security_salience += 14;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += -10;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 12;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Belarus border becomes a security and humanitarian crisis";
!}

= September 2021 — The eastern border

Belarusian ruler **Alexander Lukashenko's** authorities channel people from the
Middle East toward the Polish frontier and prevent many from returning. The Morawiecki
government asks **President [+ president_name +]** for a state of emergency along the
border. Border Guard officers and residents face a hostile-state operation;
people in the forests face exposure, pushbacks and an asylum system they cannot
reliably reach. Journalists, medics and aid groups are kept outside the zone.

PiS insists that recognising one part of the crisis means denying the other.
Lewica must decide whether it can join security, lawful processing and public
scrutiny in one administrable position—or which of them it is prepared to
leave to another party.

- @border_both
- @border_rights
- @border_security
- @border_defer

@border_both
title: Demand controlled processing, press access and humanitarian teams
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Security and rights require administration.
choose-if: resources >= 2 and border_joint_package_open = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The operation needs resources and at least one workable partner channel.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
Q.border_doctrine = "Controlled processing with monitored access";
Q.border_security_confidence += 5;
Q.minority_safety += 5;
Q.constitutional_restraint += 3;
Q.local_network += 2;
Q.military_trust += 1;
Q.far_right_agenda -= 1;
Q.ko_relation += Q.border_joint_relation_payoff;
Q.psl_relation += Math.max(1, Q.border_joint_relation_payoff - 1);
Q.p2050_relation += Q.border_joint_relation_payoff;
Q.news_headline = "The Left proposes a lawful border operation";
!}

Opposition-run municipalities, aid organisations and retired border officials
publish one operating plan: registered entry to the asylum process, security
screening, medical teams and monitored press access. KO, PSL and Poland 2050
can defend the package together because none is asked to deny the hostile-state
operation.

The government refuses to surrender command of the zone, but it can no longer
claim that humanitarian access means an unguarded frontier. Lewica owns a
proposal the state could actually administer.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@border_rights
title: Make asylum law and humanitarian access the red line
on-arrival: {!
Q.minority_safety += 7;
Q.border_doctrine = "Rights-first humanitarian access";
Q.constitutional_restraint += 5;
Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
Q.border_security_confidence -= 5;
Q.rural_support -= 1;
Q.ko_relation += Q.border_rights_relation_payoff;
Q.p2050_relation += Q.border_rights_relation_payoff;
Q.psl_relation -= 2;
Q.konf_poll_momentum += 0.25;
Q.news_headline =
    "Rights organisations gain an unqualified parliamentary ally";
!}

Lawyers, medics and the families waiting for news gain an unqualified advocate
for access and asylum law. Our deputies publish testimony from the exclusion
zone and force every pushback into the parliamentary record.

Border communities hear much less about who controls the route opened by
Minsk. PiS and Konfederacja fill that silence with their own answer, while PSL
warns that a lawful principle without an operating plan will not hold the
frontier.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@border_security
title: Support the emergency and demand later scrutiny
on-arrival: {!
Q.border_security_confidence += 8;
Q.border_doctrine = "Security first with deferred scrutiny";
Q.military_trust += 3;
Q.pis_relation += Q.border_order_relation_payoff;
Q.psl_relation += Math.max(1, Q.border_order_relation_payoff - 1);
Q.minority_safety -= 7;
Q.far_right_agenda += 4;
Q.progressives_dissent += 7;
Q.razem_dissent += 5;
Q.news_headline = "The Left gives security priority at the border";
!}

Lewica gives the emergency its parliamentary legitimacy and asks for scrutiny
after the operation. Border officers and security-minded voters recognise a
clear answer to Lukashenko; PiS accepts our votes without conceding access to
the zone.

Journalists and aid groups remain outside. Razem and the progressive current
record that “later” is doing all the work: people pushed back tonight cannot
wait for a committee convened after the emergency ends.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@border_defer
title: Let KO lead the response and avoid the trap
subtitle: Escape the immediate split while surrendering both the security and humanitarian frame.
on-arrival: border_doctrine = "Defer to KO"; ko_relation += 2; public_trust -= 3; border_security_confidence -= 2; minority_safety -= 2; far_right_agenda += 3; media_capacity -= 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += -5; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_left_ownership += -5; news_headline = "The border argument proceeds without a Left frame"

KO becomes the principal parliamentary critic and chooses which failures to
emphasise. Our caucus avoids an immediate rupture between its security and
humanitarian wings, but neither border residents nor aid organisations can say
what Lewica asked the state to do.

The silence does not depoliticise the frontier. It leaves PiS and the radical
right to define strength while the largest opposition party defines restraint.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue
